{
    "background_story": "Schmoopy was a lovable cow with a penchant for getting into sticky situations. One day, while exploring the farm, she stumbled upon a hidden patch of wildflowers and decided to indulge in a snack. Unbeknownst to her, the flowers were covered in a thick, gloopy substance called clabber - a type of fermented milk curd. As she munched away, the clabber got stuck to her fur, leaving her with a rather...unusual... appearance. The farmhands couldn't help but burst out laughing at the sight of Schmoopy, her normally sleek coat now resembling a messy, clabber-covered mess. Despite the chaos she caused, Schmoopy's playful nature and affectionate personality made her a beloved fixture on the farm, clabber and all.",
